/-!
# Explicit native reference coefficient data

Field coefficients [a,b] mean a+b*omega. The exact real coordinates
are a-b/2 and (b/2)*sqrt(3). The native cyclic slots and signed B-row gauge
are those of the fromTitsCoordinates definition. The literal data carry no
proof; every algebraic claim about them is checked by Lean.
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace ThirteenPlanes.NativeWitness.Data

